1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,500
₦50,000. A grant you never pay back.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,500
It's called NERSI: relief for poor and vulnerable households.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Beneficiaries come from the National Social Register, paid in phases.

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
So how do you apply?

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,500
You don't. You cannot apply…

6
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,500
…and no one can sell you a place on the list.

7
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,000
If you are selected, your provider sends you an SMS.

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Accept, and ₦50,000 lands in your wallet.

9
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:32,500
To check, dial any provider's code and choose ‘Check eligibility’.

10
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,500
It's free. Never pay anyone…

11
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,000
…and never share your PIN or OTP.

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Not sure? Call the help line before you do anything.

